 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? You sure can. Lots of people do it. A small desk or stand that folds out is very useful. Then think about how often you need a full desk, how often you need a good chair, and how often you'd like little bit of light and air. Then maybe get small desk that fits on side without taking up too much space. It'll beat going and coming from desk. You could get one of those little roller trays to sit on top. It gives you a useful desk without taking up space.",
